  "decision_conditions": [
    "We cannot permit the marquee as a moveable structure. This application would have to be considered on the basis of permanent retention in its current siting. \r\nThe red line on the location plan needs to be drawn wider to include all land necessary for access. We recommend the red line extends around the BHGA site in the same manner as was done on the revised location plan for 25/0135/FUL. A seperate block plan should identify the location of the marquee itself."
